# --- album-fetcher working files, never committed -------------------------
# This repo is PUBLIC. album.html is a saved copy of a Google Photos share
# page and carries the share `?key=` in its source, so committing it would
# publish access to that album. The rest is intermediate output from the same
# workflow - extracted googleusercontent URLs, thumbnails, contact sheets.
# The album data the site actually uses is albums.json, which IS tracked.
album.html
album_photos.json
album_thumbs/
contact_sheet*.jpg
*-urls.txt
